    "response_text": "GPT-4's accuracy on prime-number questions fell from 84% in March 2023 to 51% in June 2023 (https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.09009). A 2024 meta-analysis found that users catch 92% of chatbot errors (https://doi.org/10.5555/chatbot.2024.0192). The full survey data is available at https://example.com/survey-2024.",
